        "label":  "SLMP Demo",
        "disabled":  false,
        "info":  "Update the connection host, port, and controlled test addresses before deploy. The optional write path saves the original values, writes random valid values, restores after a confirmed acknowledgement, and reads again. Any error or outcome-unknown result stops automatic cleanup and requires manual reconciliation."
